    "behavior": [
      "Construct and retain the real pinned official resource/HTTP SDK instances privately, reusing one existing production server bridge and its verification-bound owners.",
      "Accept only one bounded PAYMENT-SIGNATURE scalar or null for a single configured GET /paid route. A trusted native host must authenticate and bind its request separately.",
      "Capture the actual SDK tuple in a private hook. Reuse that exact tuple through the existing same-original pending continuation without exposing SDK registries, callbacks, route objects, a cancellation dispatcher or caller-constructed tuples.",
      "A single synchronous application busy fence serializes request and explicit continuation entry; the existing continuation's native resume/close receipts are retained unchanged.",
      "Retain the original header scalar in the private request adapter. Refuse changed resource/requirement DATA before another SDK request, without resetting the original pending capability.",
      "Return only detached frozen HTTP/settlement DATA and a frozen explicit pending capability. No automatic retry, replacement, handler or delivery owner is added."
    ],
